+**Alternative Estimators:**
+For parameters $\theta_i$ with probability $p_i$, two differentiable bit estimators are compared [S2]:
+*   Eq. 6 (preferred): $\text{bit}(p_i|\theta_i) = -\left(\frac{1+\theta_i}{2}\log_2(p_i)+\frac{1-\theta_i}{2}\log_2(1-p_i)\right)$ [S2].
+*   Eq. 7 (older): $\text{bit}(p_i|\theta_i) = -\log_2\left(\frac{1-\theta_i}{2}+\theta_i p_i\right)$ [S2].
+Eq. 6 is preferred because Eq. 7's backward propagation yields a more intricate gradient, slowing training to 68 minutes and increasing BD-rate by +49.3%/+89.5% [S2].
